{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120873","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120873/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120873/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120873/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120873","id":4798466203,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHgLImw","number":120873,"title":"Using Setup or Painting physics layers onto tiles spikes 3D GPU into freezing Godot","user":{"login":"Hans-48","id":237449616,"node_id":"U_kgDODicxkA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237449616?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48","html_url":"https://github.com/Hans-48","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hans-48/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-02T21:59:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T08:30:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIssues found on Godot 4.7.1-rc., and are confirmed reproducible on Godot 4.7. Also reproducible on 4.0 with TileMap instead of TileMapLayer.\nGodot version 3.6.2 couldn't be tested as the project was incompatible.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Qualcomm(R) Adreno(TM) X1-85 GPU (Qualcomm Incorporated; 31.0.128.0) - Snapdragon(R) X Elite - X1E78100 - Qualcomm(R) Oryon(TM) CPU (12 threads) - 15.60 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nPainting or using Setup on tiles spikes GPU so much so, that laptop goes pitch black for a second before Godot freezes, having to be closed via task manager. \n\n<img width=\"2943\" height=\"1677\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9599f59f-2c7f-484e-9947-34e61a3daec5\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a TileMapLayer node.\n2. Click on the Tile Set property in the inspector and create a new TileSet. (If you want to test the painting, you can add a Physics Layer too).\n3. Drag in a spritesheet into Tile Sources.\n<img width=\"256\" height=\"256\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7867c9ea-4861-41a2-8b29-8ab50ad64405\" />\n\n4a. Go into Tile Set, setup to reproduce 3D GPU \n4b. If Tile Set is setup already, paint several tiles with physics layer to reproduce 3D GPU spike.\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120873/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120873/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}